        <p>* Costumes, Coats, nd Skirts ready to wear.</p>
        <p>Household Linen.</p>
        <p>Suits, readu to wear.</p>
        <p>Genuine Bargains are offered in this section of our business. All goods are reduced and should be inspected early.</p>
        <p>All the newest and most up-to-date Tailor-made Coats and Skirts, Ready to wear. Gowns, Costumes, and Wash- ing Skirts are reduced regard- less of cost, and must be cleared. They are all hand- some productions, trimmed and embroidered and lined with silk and satin.</p>
        <p>An exceptional offer of Gents' Flannel Suits—a fine range of all the newest color- ings, checks, stripes and mix- tures. Real comfort in hot weather, and most suitable for business or holiday wear. Suits of three garments from 19/6. Black and coloured Alpaca Jackets from 4/11. Tweed and Flannel Jackets from 3/11. Norfolk Jackets from 12/6. Raincoats from 17/6. Cycling Capes from 4/11.</p>
        <p>Damask Table Cloths, Hemmed, ?Ids. square from 5/11. Damask Serviettes, Hemmed from 5/11. Bleached and Unbleached Sheets from 3/11. Bed Covers, ready for use, 4/11. Blankets from 11/6 pair. Cot Blankets 4/11 pair. Counterpanes and Bedspreads, Satin. Dimity, Honeycomb, White Grecian, from 4/11. Cot Counterpanes, from 2/4i. Pillow and Bolster Cases, from 6id. Towels from 6id. Flannels, Flanneletets and Calicoes from sd.</p>
        <p>Empire Gowns, £3 19/6 Coats and Skirts from 21 1!- Skirts from 5/11 Coats from 6/11</p>
        <p>~,,, ~,,,, ,</p>
        <p>Ladies' Underclothing.</p>
        <p>Gents' Shirts and Shirtings.</p>
        <p>Smart, stylishly cut, and well-made under- clothing, greatly reduced and must be cleared.</p>
        <p>Our shirts have always been known for their superior quality and lasting wear. These are no exception and are our regular stock. Smart Print Shirts—stiff fronts and cuffs or stiff cuffs only 2/11. Oxford and Zephyr Shirts 2/11. Ceylon and Flannel Shirts 2/11. White and coloured Cellular Shirts 3/6.</p>
        <p>Divided Skirts, Silk, and Silk Moirette Skirts from 2/11. Pretty Snow White Skirts, trimmed embroidery from 3/11. Cambric Knickers, trimmed lace and insertion from 3/6. Nainsook Camisoles from 1/11id. Vests from 61-cl. Merino and Wool Combinations, dainty Dressing Gowns and Jackets. Corsets and Stays, the leading makes, all reduced and are quite new.</p>
