        <p>We have an extensive range of the newest shades of Silks. All first quality goods. Glace, Paillette and Mery Silks 1./I.li yard. Black Paiillette Silk (double width) 36in. wide 2/6 yard. Cotton Back Satins Cid. yard. Washing Silks from 1./2i yard. Shan- tung Silks from 1/4i yard. Furs, a splendid collection of Fur Ties and Muffs in Sable, Mink, Ermine, Squirrel, Mole, Fox, etc., at greatly reduced prices. This is the time to buy your furs for the Winter Season.</p>
