        <head>HOME DOCTOR BOOK FREE.</head>
        <p>HOME DOCTOR BOOK FREE.</p>
        <p>Mmiyon's Guide to Health," describes most diseases, giving their symptoms and the instruc- tions for treatment so plainly that one has simply to vselect the remedy, get a shilling bottle from the chemist and cure one's self. This Home Doctor Book can be obtained post free by any- one (mentioning the Warrington " Examiner ") addressing Aluny,on, Olt New Oxford Street, London, W.C.</p>
