        <p>ORFORD TANNERY V. KING AND QUEEN.—This friendly game Of bowls took place on Wednesday even- ing at Orford and resulted in a win for King and Queen by ii. Details :</p>
        <p>ORFORD TANNERY. RING AND QUEEN. H. Williams l3 P Tomlinson Jas. Povey J. Skelhorn l2 S. Riley l3 H. Taker 4 P. Appleton l3 C. Povey l3 J. Ashall W. Povey, sen. S. Dutton</p>
