      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1909-06-26_WidnesExaminer_art0114" n="art0114">
        <head>REMARKABLE SUCCESS attends the recent free gifts of DR. CASSELL'S TABLETS.</head>
        <p>REMARKABLE SUCCESS attends the recent free gifts of DR. CASSELL'S TABLETS.</p>
        <p>We learn that apart from the general interest which attended the free distribution of Dr. Cassell's Tablets In Warrington recently, remarkable success in many local cases have been reported. This is perhaps not to be wondered at, considering the unique nerve-Invigorat- ing and body-building qualities which we are assured Jr. Cassell's Tablets possess; and we feel certain that this remedy entirely vindicates all that is claimed for it. We have nG reason for doubting the fact that Dr. Cassell's Tablets are a certain cure for loss of flesh, bodily weakness, anzemia, debility, paralysis of the. nerves, spinal paralysis, children's weakness, kidney and stomach troubles, heart weakness and all forms of physical and nerve exhaustion, and have no hesitation in advising anyone suffering from any of these to procure a- tenpence-halfpenny, one and Ogee- halfpence, or two and nine box of Dr. Cassell's Tablets at once. We hear that Dr. Cassell's Tablets are sold at all .chemists and are recommended amongst other. authorities by Dr. Ramsay Cones, J.P., of Loudon, end Dr.Torabdis, D.Sc., of Bradford.</p>
