      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1909-06-26_WidnesExaminer_art0118" n="art0118">
        <head>EASTBOURNE'S ROYAL</head>
        <p>EASTBOURNE'S ROYAL</p>
        <p>VISITOR.</p>
        <p>THE CROWN PRINCESS OF GREECE.</p>
        <p>Much interest has been aroused at East- bourne in the approaching arrival of the Crown Princess of Greece who is expected with her children at the South Coast health resort before the end of the week. The Crown Princess is passionately fond Of England, and this is the fourth year in which she has Nisited some South Coast health resort. ‘.,</p>
