      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1909-06-26_WidnesExaminer_art0126" n="art0126">
        <head>SCHOOL OF ART.</head>
        <p>SCHOOL OF ART.</p>
        <p>WOODCARVING (Elementary.)—Second class : Frank Bailey. PdSS : 'Mows B. Weaver.</p>
        <p>ARPLEY-BTREET INTERMEDIATE TECHNICAL</p>
        <p>INSIITUTE.</p>
