        <head>EXAMINATION FOR BURSARIES.</head>
        <p>EXAMINATION FOR BURSARIES.</p>
        <p>The following is a list, arranged in order of merit, of the candidates who have passed the examination for Bursaries of the value of £lO per annum, together with free tuition at the Secondary School and the necersary books :—Ethel Cooper, Gladys Joynson, Mary Hackett, Ethel May Harris, Frank Knowles, Miriam Russell, Florence Clarke, Dorothy Mary Collin, Dorothy Denham, -Mary Plinston, Aaa Atherton, Lillias Johnson, Florence Gordon. Margaret Costelloe, Annie Wilkinson. Edwin R. Hodgson, Dowthy Harrison and Lillian Butter worth.</p>
