        <p>BUTTER.</p>
        <p>CORK, THURSDAY.—Good supply, with a lively demand and steady prices. Firsts 89s: seconds 87s; thirds 80s ; fourths 725. Mild cured : Superflno 100 s; fine 90s ; choicest boxes 935. Fresh butter 945.</p>
