        <p>_ MANCHESTER, THURSDAY.—Potatoes: Yorkshire warps, 6s 6d to 7s; ditto sands, 58 6d to 6s 6d; Cheshire old, 4s to 4s Gd; ditto new, 17s to 19s: Lincoln kidneys, Os 6d tc 7s; ditto sands, 5s 6d to Gs 6d per load (18 stones-2521b.) ; Jersey, Os Gd to 7s; Male, 6s 6d to 7s per cwt. English peas, Gs to 8s per pot; English tomatoes, 3s to 3s 6d per 121 b • Guernsey ditto, 2.72dt o 3d per lb ; cherries, is to Is id per box, 9s per sieve; English gooseberries, 7s to 8s per cwt.; English straw- berries, is to Is 6d per basket; Somerset, 3d to 4d per lb.; Kent, 4s per peck; red currants' 3s 6d to 4s per 121 b.; green plums, 7s 6d per sieve ; English peaches, 4s to 7s per dozen; French. is to Is Gd per box; German whinberries, 5s 3d to 58 6d per chip; English kidney beans, 10d per lb. FISH. GAME AND POULTRY. - - • -----------</p>
        <p>MANCHESTER, THunsDAY.---Wholesale quotations: Young Australian rabbits. is ; ditto large furred, is per couple. Russian black game, 3s ; ditto ptarmigan 2s per brace. Irish chickens, Is 2d to 2s Gd ; ditto, fowls, is 6d to is 9d; ditto ducklings, is 6d to Ss each. American chickens, 10d per lb. Lobster, Bd. Aberdeen finnons, sd; Grimsby ditto, 3d ; medium soles, is; large ditto, 10d ; small halibut, 5d to 6d ; large ditto, 4d; fresh-water eels, 5d to 6d ; turbot 9d ; brill, 8d ; Irish and Scotch salmon, Is; grilse, 9d to lOd ; chilled ditto, 8d ; trout, is 4d ; small pollan, 3d ; large ditto, Gd per lb. Best cod, is 9d; sprag, Is 4d ; best White Sea plaice, is 6d ; best English Dogger plaice, 6s ; small ditto, Se; skate wings, 2s ; white hake, Is 6d ; whitings, 2s; conger eels, is 9d; fresh haddocks' 2s ; colefish. 10d; lemon soles, 5s to 6s per stone. Best crabs 2s 6d per dozen. Best herrings, 5s per 100* Mackerel, 2s to 3s per score.</p>
